  "evidence": "\"Principle licenses are $129 for each computer you want to use it on\"; teams add seats to a license key in My Account, with no user accounts, SSO or provisioning.",
  "notes": "New row. Principle is a macOS prototyping app sold as a perpetual per-computer license key ($129; renewal $99 per computer for another year of feature updates and Share to Web). Teams add seats to a license through the My Account page (looked up by email or license key). There is no organization admin console, no SSO, no SCIM and no public API; the docs, FAQ and site sitemap mention none. Per-user monthly fields stay null because pricing is a one-time license. Status none by absence.",
